WEBVTT

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.710
What's up, Miyuki?

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.420
Father, it's snowing.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.010
You should go inside. Keep warm.

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:56.430
No, I want to see it.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.680
She's just like you.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.780
I don't want you to freeze, my treasure.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:19.910
Snowfall.

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.160
Maybe the last one this year.

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:38.930
Please. Tell me, Unmo.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.800
Am I--

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.770
Am I human, or a kabane?

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.940
<i>Kabane. Walking corpses.</i>

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:55.690
<i>The undead.</i>

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.990
<i>The land of Hinomoto was in danger...</i>

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:03.580
<i>of being overrun by them.</i>

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.760
<i>After the destruction of Kongokaku,</i>

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:30.020
<i>the Amatori shogunate had fallen,
so the various spheres of influence...</i>

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.690
<i>were forced to fight
the kabane separately.</i>

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:39.740
<i>In order to cross the Hida mountains,
the Iron Fortress...</i>

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:42.620
<i>had reached Unalo in Hokuriku.</i>

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:49.080
<i>The kabane had made
Unato impassable 5 years ago.</i>

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:52.790
<i>The allied forces of Hokuriku
attempted to recapture it,</i>

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.710
<i>turning it info a battlefield.</i>

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:01.300
Kabane!
we'll intercept them!

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.810
Unato Militia, forward!
Fix that later!

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.980
Release the safety catch.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:13.770
Fire!

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:23.660
I've no time to make dinner.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:27.450
Your hubby's been conscripted too.
Said your farewells?

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.120
I'm prepared for the worst.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.080
- Kabane?
- Quick!

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:52.020
Unbelievable.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:57.480
The allied forces' rearguard is so weak.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.790
Not enough defensive strength.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.420
Biba thinks so too.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.600
Everyone, support the front line!

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.720
Water off. Forward!

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.060
Forward!

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:38.400
Link up with the allies!

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.280
The air's stagnant.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.450
There are so many of them.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:54.580
The front line's about 200 yards away.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.420
It'll take 30 seconds.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:28.700
You should train in the next world.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.160
Damn you to hell!

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.790
It took me 38 seconds.

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:41.290
The Iron Fortress-

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.960
You're supposed to attack their rear.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.590
Already done it.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.890
Do your own job before criticizing me.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:58.060
Move.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.540
Wow!

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.210
Are you-

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.630
Yeah.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:31.720
I'm a kabaneri.
A human-kabane hybrid.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:45.780
Again? What's happening to me?

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:54.870
Huh?

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.620
Damn.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.330
Mumei!

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:08.760
Are you OK?

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.380
Are you hurt?

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:14.100
Ikoma.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.640
Look lively.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.980
- Let's get them.
- OK.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:24.360
Grab my hand!

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.110
Now, Mumei!

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:51.340
No more kabane!

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.550
Victory is ours!

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:56.260
Are you OK?

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:58.930
Yeah. Thanks.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.270
She doesn't look well either.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:05.690
So it isn't just me.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.440
Watcha doing?
Going back to your nest?

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.740
Huh?

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.610
I know that you're a kabaneri too.

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:18.080
A weak and ugly one at that!

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:21.540
We killed a few of your buddies,
but it ain't over.

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:27.500
No matter how many we Kill,
they keep on coming.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:31.300
Make any false moves
and I'll lock you up.

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:37.720
Move the guard fence forward!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:41.470
Keep going! Keep going!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:44.770
The Iron Fortress has reached them?

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:48.810
Yes, sir. We've recaptured Sector 5,

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:52.070
and almost captured Unato Castle.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:54.450
A great success.

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:57.700
Unato is cursed.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:01.870
We'll destroy the castle
and burn everything.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.250
She needs an overhaul.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.670
We've been pushing her hard.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.840
We need manpower.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.010
What's up, Ikoma?

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:19.680
The kabane here are weird.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:20.970
What do you mean?

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:22.180
Look.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:28.980
Their footprints. As if they're all
heading to the same place.

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:33.940
The ones me and Mumei killed
weren't just after blood.

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:36.860
They attacked humans in unison.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.450
You mean they're disciplined?

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:40.990
That's right.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.460
Kabane research notes?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:52.170
Takumi wrote them with me.
I'm continuing our work.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:55.090
Your head hurts?

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:59.720
Yeah. Ever since we came here.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:15.480
<i>Allied Forces HQ
Unato Station</i>

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:14.170
-Welcome back!
- I made soup.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.660
Thanks!

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:20.620
I'm back, Lady Ayame.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.120
Welcome back, Kurusu.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:31.040
Thanks to you, we were saved.
You were on your way home?

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.000
Yes.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:36.170
Aragane Station. We're taking
rice seedlings to plant.

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:40.050
Everyone thinks fondly
of their own home town.

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.180
Mumei!
You didn't get hurt?

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:47.600
- I'm fine, Kajika.
- Put some "mecidine" on.

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:51.230
Sayo, you're talking really well now!

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:54.440
Mumei, how's the steam cartridge gun?

00:10:55.440 --> 00:11:01.030
It handles well, but loses power and
is hard to load, so only I can use it.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:05.200
I've been betrayed!

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:07.330
I don't think so.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:11.960
Let's finish off that thing tonight.

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:17.130
That's it.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.300
Now pull the yarn through the loop.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:27.680
- It's finished!
- Well done! It's beautiful.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:37.230
I was surprised when you said
you wanted to give him a present.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.820
I guess you like the necklace.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:44.660
Well, I just thought he needed
something for his hand.

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.740
What did he say about it?

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:53.870
"My sister Hatsune and Fat Takumi
will protect me, so you keep it."

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:57.590
"Whatever it takes,
I'll turn you human again."

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.420
No way! Ikoma promised you that?

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:04.840
So he wants to marry you?

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:07.530
No, he doesn't!

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.930
That dummy makes the same
promise to everyone!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:14.600
That's not true.
Ikoma has the hots for you.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:17.360
No he doesn't, I'm telling you!

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:20.320
Alright, alright, I get it.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.450
Mend it. You're giving it
to him tomorrow.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.920
He really doesn't, OK?

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.530
It's pretty conclusive.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:11.870
The kabane's footprints also lead from
Sector 6. There must be a secret route.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:15.580
We have to tell everyone.
Come on, Sukari.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.090
Mumei. What's up?

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:22.510
Go on!

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.800
Ikoma, I have something for you.

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:27.840
What is it?

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:31.600
Not here. Somewhere quieter.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:34.390
Lady Ayame, wait for me!

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:36.270
Later, OK? I'm busy now.

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:38.020
It won't take long!

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.060
Tell me later!

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:43.980
Sorry.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.570
What's with that grumpy face?

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.950
Let's try another time, Mumei.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.330
No. Forget about it.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.950
What!?

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.370
Kajika, give me a hand!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.000
Just a minute!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.960
We're at the final stage.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:08.760
We hold Sector 5, so the Narukami
self-propelled siege mortar...

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.300
can be brought within
 range of the target.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.300
<i>Kuroji Army of Shirnano </i>

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:18.350
This means we can eradicate
the whole kabane nest in one fell swoop.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:16.460
<i>Mogari Army of Echigo</i>

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:22.150
As long as the Narukami comes---

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:25.610
I heard it blew away
3000 kabane at Musashi.

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:28.360
Then the Chubu line will soon be clear.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:32.200
And then we'll be able
to get out of this place.

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:35.080
And see our families again.

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:43.380
The operation will begin when
the Narukami arrives in 4 days.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:46.380
The Kuroji and Mogari forces...

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:51.970
will enter Sector 3 with the Narukami
and bombard Unato Castle.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:56.520
The Iron Fortress will protect
the track workers at the front line.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:15:01.600
We'll increase the Unato Militia by 200
to lay reinforced tracks.

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.560
Is that alright, Lord Unmo?

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:08.280
But many of my men
were wounded yesterday.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:12.820
Track work is always done in front
of the locomotive. It's too risky-

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:14.410
Enough already!

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:18.870
When the snow melts,
it won't just be us who will be mobile.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.500
They could retake our territory!

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:27.000
We'll work together.
This is to defend your homeland.

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:32.090
What if they attack
from the territory they occupy?

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:36.890
Over here!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.520
Hurry up!

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:43.810
How come it's broken?

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.270
He stepped on it.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:48.820
You shouldn't have left it lying around!

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:53.030
Stop them crying!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.160
Sorry.

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:57.410
This is awful. Everyone's on edge.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:00.000
- Shut up!
- You shut up!

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:04.420
Stop arguing.
Hinomoto is in grave danger.

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:08.250
You might never see each other again.

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:15.300
As I just said, the kabane are
all heading towards our forward base.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:19.680
<i>They're coming from Sector 6 foo,
 which is in our rear.</i>

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:26.060
They may be being summoned
via an unknown route.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:31.650
We must spare some troops to defend
our rear. Let me investigate first.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.450
Erm-

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.950
That's ridiculous.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:46.210
Those brainless kabane
aren't capable of such a thing.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:51.840
If someone really is summoning them,
you're the most likely suspect.

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:54.010
Lord Kuroji!

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:57.930
As I told you,
the kabane here are weird!

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:00.060
They're coming to kill us!

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:03.230
Someone must be controlling them.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:05.890
So let me investigate!

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:10.940
What's wrong, Ikoma?

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:13.030
What's with him?

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:15.820
A kabane bit him at Aragane Station.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:20.660
You're the one who's here to kill us!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:21.620
Let go!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.210
Ikoma!

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:27.620
What the hell?

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.640
Another headache? You need rest.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:43.520
No time to rest.
I have to go-

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:44.730
Don't be silly.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:48.480
This is a war council.
He should know his place.

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:52.940
My apologies. He's worked up
from all the fighting.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.280
- Don't apologize!
- Quiet!

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.990
Don't worry, I'll talk to him.

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.380
Ikoma, about earlier-

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:19.720
What are you doing?

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:22.720
I'm leaving to go investigate.

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:24.140
Where?

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:29.770
To where the kabane are coming from.
Nobody will listen to me.

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:33.610
I need to find conclusive evidence.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.860
No, I won't let you!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:38.110
What?

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:45.540
If you go alone, you'll just
get killed by the kabane.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:49.000
Don't take such a stupid risk.

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:52.170
I'd be-

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.590
You don't believe me either?

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:02.340
Are you on the side of the Allied Forces
just like Lady Ayame?

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:06.220
You did the same thing when
the Karikata Militia came.

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:07.520
Stop it.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:12.650
That was because I didn't want the
Tron Fortress crew to he against Biba.

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:14.900
Why are you saying that?

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:20.400
Even if nobody believes me,
we're facing a huge threat.

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:23.280
I'll find the truth
before it's too late!

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:26.410
But is it worth your life?

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:30.500
My life? I don't care if I die!

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.760
Ikoma. Ikoma!

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.930
What's wrong, Ikoma?

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.190
- There he is!
- Freeze!

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.440
No!

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.920
Sure. Bite me.

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:26.510
You won't become human with me.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:31.770
You'll forget your promise...

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:35.440
and die alone.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:38.690
I don't care.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.620
- Mumei.
- Gotcha!

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.790
I've got him!

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:54.370
Let go! I'm-

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:55.670
Are you OK?

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:57.380
Please stand clear.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.420
Ikoma, what are you?

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.000
Kurusu, I'm-

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:02.340
Wanna die too?

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:03.420
Wait!

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:07.260
I have an idea. Put me-

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:11.140
Put me in a cell!

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:12.770
Huh?

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:18.440
If I don't turn into a kabane
within 3 days, it means I'm safe.

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:22.110
I won't try to escape.
Give me a chance!

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:26.780
Alright.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:36.080
Lock this kabaneri up in the foundry.
If he makes any false moves, shoot him.

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:37.250
OK?

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:39.670
That's fine.

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:43.210
Take him away.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:47.180
Are you sure, Sir?

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:51.470
Better than him wandering free.
If he's in the way, kill him.

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:55.100
Not so hard! I'm not resisting!

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:57.940
Mumei!

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:02.770
I'll be back for the Narukami operation,
so wait for me!

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:03.820
Alright?

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:06.900
Mumei!

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:09.240
Mumei!

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:19.680
Men!

00:23:20.310 --> 00:23:21.400
Kote!

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:30.400
- I struck too shallow?
- Yes. You're unfocused.

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:32.910
Thinking about Ikoma?

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:34.870
Yes.

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:40.250
He clearly wasn't his normal self.

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:44.630
Maybe he sees something
nobody else can see.

00:23:45.670 --> 00:23:49.630
Maybe there was something
I could have done.

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:56.260
I don't know what Ikoma is thinking,

00:23:56.810 --> 00:24:00.390
and I have no idea what he can see.

00:24:02.060 --> 00:24:06.480
But he's never failed to perceive...

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:08.730
the true enemy.

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:12.650
He's sure someone is
controlling the kabane.

00:24:13.860 --> 00:24:16.240
He perceives the enemy.

00:24:17.030 --> 00:24:18.450
That enemy...

00:24:20.080 --> 00:24:21.250
is our enemy.

00:24:24.420 --> 00:24:28.420
That's right. I believe him too.

00:24:32.300 --> 00:24:33.180
Hurgh!

00:24:35.590 --> 00:24:38.260
What? An underground passage?

00:24:38.390 --> 00:24:41.810
Yes. It extends from
the keep of Unato Castle.

00:24:42.140 --> 00:24:46.810
Lord Kageyuki constructed it
as an escape route from the kabane.

00:24:47.440 --> 00:24:50.900
Kageyuki? Kageyuki Komai?

00:24:51.030 --> 00:24:53.820
- Lord of the castle.
- Yes.

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:57.780
To defend Unato, he led in the vanguard.

00:24:58.280 --> 00:24:59.780
A great man.

00:25:00.830 --> 00:25:06.000
Apparently, the passage connects
to the old mine railroad.

00:25:06.120 --> 00:25:09.880
The kabane from Sector 6
probably came through here.

00:25:10.960 --> 00:25:13.800
In other words, Ikoma was right.

00:25:14.300 --> 00:25:16.220
Please let us investigate.

00:25:16.890 --> 00:25:20.140
We need to do it now,
before the Narukami operation.

00:25:21.850 --> 00:25:23.850
I will guide you.

00:25:25.390 --> 00:25:29.230
It's a very dangerous mission.
Are you sure?

00:25:31.150 --> 00:25:34.440
There's something there I want to check.

00:25:34.610 --> 00:25:37.070
Can you handle the track work?

00:25:38.910 --> 00:25:40.330
Alright.

00:25:41.700 --> 00:25:46.330
Everyone, another huge battle
lies ahead of us.

00:25:46.960 --> 00:25:50.500
Combining our strength,
we'll pass through Unato,

00:25:50.880 --> 00:25:55.760
then return to Aragane Station,
plow the fields, and plant rice.

00:25:56.220 --> 00:25:57.840
We're almost there.

00:25:58.590 --> 00:26:00.350
I'll go too.

00:26:01.300 --> 00:26:04.770
- That would be great, but-
- Mumei, are you sure?

00:26:05.230 --> 00:26:07.730
Don't you want to wait for Ikoma?

00:26:07.850 --> 00:26:09.850
I want to be active.

00:26:11.060 --> 00:26:13.480
I can't stand just hanging around.

00:26:29.370 --> 00:26:32.590
The tunnel's blocked.

00:26:34.130 --> 00:26:36.090
How about that one?

00:26:40.890 --> 00:26:42.550
A hidden tunnel!

00:26:42.680 --> 00:26:46.680
No way! The kabane aren't
capable of such a thing.

00:26:49.190 --> 00:26:50.480
Look!

00:26:51.650 --> 00:26:54.770
A metallic membrane, from the kabane.

00:27:16.000 --> 00:27:18.260
The Narukami has arrived in Unato!

00:27:18.380 --> 00:27:20.680
<i>It's approaching number 2!</i>

00:27:22.640 --> 00:27:26.510
Forward!
Take only battle gear, not food!

00:27:29.890 --> 00:27:31.270
Huh? Already?

00:27:31.390 --> 00:27:32.560
A day early?

00:27:32.690 --> 00:27:35.020
Hurry! The kabane won't wait for us!

00:27:35.570 --> 00:27:39.650
I wish I could have
one last taste of your stew.

00:27:39.780 --> 00:27:42.990
You'll be back. You can have it then.

00:27:44.370 --> 00:27:48.200
We'll go via the Irakazui Line,
and attack from Sector 3.

00:27:48.330 --> 00:27:50.370
Godspeed, men.

00:27:53.960 --> 00:27:55.380
What's going on?

00:27:56.210 --> 00:27:58.090
We aren't due to begin-

00:27:58.210 --> 00:28:02.340
There's been little snow,
so the Narukami got here early.

00:28:02.470 --> 00:28:03.130
But-

00:28:03.260 --> 00:28:07.640
The Iron Fortress will defend
the track work as planned.

00:28:08.100 --> 00:28:09.560
Lord Kuroji!

00:28:10.390 --> 00:28:13.600
They haven't got back yet.
Should we wait?

00:28:13.730 --> 00:28:18.360
We can't leave civilians undefended.
Get ready to leave.

00:28:18.480 --> 00:28:19.780
What about Ikoma?

00:28:21.860 --> 00:28:25.370
We'll alert Sukari's team.
Send them a message.

00:28:33.040 --> 00:28:35.880
We're attacking before
the taro stems dry?

00:28:36.960 --> 00:28:38.500
Mumei.

00:28:42.170 --> 00:28:43.800
They're attacking?

00:28:44.380 --> 00:28:46.010
How come?

00:28:50.140 --> 00:28:52.560
What are you doing? We're attacking.

00:28:52.680 --> 00:28:56.270
Going to talk to your kabane buddies?

00:28:56.400 --> 00:28:57.730
Lunatics!

00:28:57.860 --> 00:28:59.150
You what?

00:29:01.940 --> 00:29:02.780
Get back!

00:29:06.030 --> 00:29:07.160
Kabane?

00:29:19.340 --> 00:29:20.300
Damn you!

00:29:23.720 --> 00:29:24.880
Huh?

00:29:33.850 --> 00:29:35.690
Lunatics!

00:29:37.600 --> 00:29:39.440
Mumei, come on!

00:29:41.400 --> 00:29:45.950
Ikoma said someone's controlling them.
I'm going after the leader.

00:29:49.910 --> 00:29:50.740
Mumei!

00:30:19.020 --> 00:30:20.560
What the hell?

00:30:20.810 --> 00:30:22.610
The kabane are here!

00:30:26.820 --> 00:30:29.700
Suzunari, you can see kabane?

00:30:30.620 --> 00:30:35.160
The operation has begun.
What's going on?

00:31:15.200 --> 00:31:16.950
They set a trap?

00:31:19.250 --> 00:31:21.460
I can hear kabane!

00:31:21.580 --> 00:31:24.040
Shut up and work!

00:31:27.550 --> 00:31:30.300
Lady Ayame, we've entered Sector 2.

00:31:30.970 --> 00:31:32.970
We'll defend from here.

00:31:33.180 --> 00:31:35.850
The gradient is 3%.

00:31:36.100 --> 00:31:38.060
I'll use the track brakes.

00:31:38.180 --> 00:31:39.640
Go ahead.

00:31:43.900 --> 00:31:45.820
Unato Castle is in range.

00:31:45.940 --> 00:31:47.190
Release the safety.

00:31:47.900 --> 00:31:50.820
Prepare to fire.
Turn to 110 degrees.

00:31:58.580 --> 00:32:01.120
Hey, set me free!

00:32:02.250 --> 00:32:03.920
Can't you hear me?

00:32:05.250 --> 00:32:07.250
I knew it.

00:32:07.920 --> 00:32:09.710
Be quiet.

00:32:11.260 --> 00:32:15.390
The kabaneri who went into the mine.
She's a collaborator too!

00:32:15.720 --> 00:32:18.640
You mean Mumei?
She entered the mine?

00:32:20.220 --> 00:32:22.190
Stop using human words!

00:32:22.310 --> 00:32:25.190
You brought the kabane here!

00:32:28.940 --> 00:32:33.240
I've told you so many times.
We're in grave danger.

00:32:33.700 --> 00:32:38.450
But you guys went ahead and attacked,

00:32:38.990 --> 00:32:42.160
putting Mumei in danger!

00:32:44.670 --> 00:32:45.500
Look out!

00:33:27.210 --> 00:33:28.040
Fire!

00:33:47.190 --> 00:33:49.060
The membrane is too hard.

00:33:49.190 --> 00:33:51.070
Adjust the aim and fire again.

00:33:51.770 --> 00:33:52.820
Reload!

00:34:06.000 --> 00:34:08.500
There are kabane up ahead, Ikoma!

00:34:23.010 --> 00:34:25.310
<i>This is weird.</i>

00:34:26.020 --> 00:34:31.110
<i>Even without Ikoma, I've vowed
to find the secret of this place.</i>

00:34:35.030 --> 00:34:40.280
<i>I'm so scared, and so lonely.</i>

00:34:46.750 --> 00:34:48.620
<i>I miss Ikoma.</i>

00:35:09.520 --> 00:35:11.980
A kabane, even here!

00:35:22.200 --> 00:35:23.740
Ready to fire!

00:35:23.990 --> 00:35:25.580
5 seconds!

00:35:36.250 --> 00:35:38.050
What's that?

00:35:38.210 --> 00:35:39.630
Blood?

00:35:52.100 --> 00:35:53.810
What the-

00:35:53.940 --> 00:35:55.110
What's wrong?

00:36:02.030 --> 00:36:03.410
What should we do?

00:36:03.530 --> 00:36:04.870
Fire!

00:36:30.770 --> 00:36:32.600
Lady Ayame, the Narukami-

00:36:32.730 --> 00:36:33.770
It's gone silent?

00:36:33.900 --> 00:36:36.900
The Kuroji Army's locomotive
is covered in kabane!

00:36:37.020 --> 00:36:37.860
What!?

00:36:38.860 --> 00:36:40.610
Damn you!

00:36:43.150 --> 00:36:45.950
How come the kabane are-

00:36:47.160 --> 00:36:48.780
Unbelievable!

00:36:58.000 --> 00:37:02.840
We mobilized so many troops.
We must complete the mission!

00:37:08.600 --> 00:37:11.220
Damn your eyes!

00:37:11.350 --> 00:37:13.680
Get off me!

00:37:32.120 --> 00:37:33.410
Darling!

00:37:50.680 --> 00:37:53.980
Right. I'm gonna turn you human again.

00:37:57.060 --> 00:37:58.980
<i>"Hozumi"</i>

00:37:59.770 --> 00:38:02.070
Just as your mom wished,

00:38:03.030 --> 00:38:04.940
eat lots of rice!

00:39:35.580 --> 00:39:37.080
Ikoma!

00:40:11.990 --> 00:40:13.280
Ikoma!

00:40:17.330 --> 00:40:18.290
Mumei.

00:40:18.410 --> 00:40:21.290
I'm here. You're badly wounded.

00:40:21.410 --> 00:40:23.120
Mumei, I-

00:40:23.250 --> 00:40:24.750
No, don't talk.

00:40:24.880 --> 00:40:28.630
I haven t forgotten my promise to you.
I haven't.

00:40:28.750 --> 00:40:31.420
I know. You don't need to talk.

00:40:31.550 --> 00:40:35.390
Stay by my side. Never leave me.

00:40:41.560 --> 00:40:44.190
Say that once more.

00:40:44.850 --> 00:40:48.520
Don't leave. Stay with me.

00:40:48.980 --> 00:40:50.320
Always.

00:41:21.020 --> 00:41:22.480
Come on!

00:41:22.680 --> 00:41:25.270
Once we've finished this-

00:41:25.440 --> 00:41:27.100
One's got through!

00:41:32.190 --> 00:41:33.400
Is everyone OK?

00:41:34.150 --> 00:41:35.360
We're almost done.

00:41:35.780 --> 00:41:38.120
Purify the 6 senses!

00:41:39.200 --> 00:41:43.620
Ikoma's cell was empty.
Sukari's team is heading to the mine.

00:41:43.750 --> 00:41:45.660
They'll meet us at the keep.

00:41:45.790 --> 00:41:47.120
I see.

00:41:47.330 --> 00:41:49.080
But where's Ikoma?

00:41:49.340 --> 00:41:51.590
He's also heading to the keep.

00:41:52.590 --> 00:41:57.090
He must be gunning for the leader.
We should advance too.

00:41:58.800 --> 00:42:00.220
You're right.

00:42:00.930 --> 00:42:02.100
Come on!

00:42:02.770 --> 00:42:05.730
The locomotive is waiting for us.

00:42:06.230 --> 00:42:07.690
Lord Mogari.

00:42:08.310 --> 00:42:09.810
Where are you going?

00:42:09.940 --> 00:42:13.610
Leave us alone!
The Narukami operation has failed.

00:42:14.030 --> 00:42:15.360
We're retreating.

00:42:16.280 --> 00:42:17.320
Kote!

00:42:19.370 --> 00:42:20.700
Huh?

00:42:21.080 --> 00:42:22.580
No retreat.

00:42:23.290 --> 00:42:27.790
A samurai must defend people.
A coward is no better than a kabane!

00:42:29.120 --> 00:42:30.790
What was that light?

00:42:31.210 --> 00:42:35.710
My headache has gone. How come?

00:42:36.340 --> 00:42:39.550
Just like when I saved you at Kongokaku.

00:42:39.680 --> 00:42:42.510
Both my fears and pain have gone.

00:42:43.010 --> 00:42:44.930
Ikoma, there you are!

00:42:46.310 --> 00:42:47.310
Sukari!

00:42:47.430 --> 00:42:49.230
I thought you'd be here.

00:42:49.940 --> 00:42:50.980
<i>Are you both OK?</i>

00:42:51.110 --> 00:42:52.190
Yeah!

00:42:52.570 --> 00:42:57.650
So it was worth me coming.
You forgot this.

00:43:00.700 --> 00:43:02.950
We're departing. Forward!

00:43:03.280 --> 00:43:04.580
Forward!

00:43:08.460 --> 00:43:10.750
Straight into Unato Castle!

00:43:16.420 --> 00:43:21.260
Support them!
How dare she call us cowards!

00:43:21.390 --> 00:43:22.640
That girl-

00:43:39.650 --> 00:43:41.070
Next is straight on!

00:44:03.140 --> 00:44:04.640
Stand by! OK!

00:44:04.760 --> 00:44:05.930
OK, Tanzaemon!

00:44:14.980 --> 00:44:15.940
We're through!

00:44:16.070 --> 00:44:17.400
Nice one!

00:44:41.600 --> 00:44:44.090
This is the keep?

00:44:45.720 --> 00:44:47.970
Hey, what's that?

00:44:52.140 --> 00:44:53.980
A blue cocoon.

00:44:55.690 --> 00:44:57.150
And a child?

00:44:58.270 --> 00:44:59.610
Let me look.

00:45:05.740 --> 00:45:07.280
I knew it.

00:45:12.120 --> 00:45:15.080
Shojin! You've been shot.

00:45:15.210 --> 00:45:17.130
A kabane with a gun!?

00:45:17.540 --> 00:45:18.790
Back to the gallery!

00:45:30.600 --> 00:45:32.430
As I thought, Lord Kageyuki.

00:45:33.060 --> 00:45:34.480
He's over there.

00:45:34.600 --> 00:45:36.690
Kageyuki Komai?

00:45:36.810 --> 00:45:39.310
- But he's-
- He isn't dead.

00:45:40.270 --> 00:45:44.860
That fateful night, he squeezed
his own throat and survived.

00:45:46.200 --> 00:45:48.780
So just like Ikoma-

00:45:48.990 --> 00:45:50.950
He's a kabaneri?

00:45:53.290 --> 00:45:59.000
5 years ago, he fought to protect Unato.
He survived, but the shogun's samurai...

00:45:59.170 --> 00:46:02.630
pointed their guns at him,
thinking he was a kabane.

00:46:04.510 --> 00:46:07.840
I was right there with them.

00:46:10.510 --> 00:46:14.890
Please. Tell me, Unmo.

00:46:15.890 --> 00:46:17.350
Am I-

00:46:18.650 --> 00:46:21.610
Am I human, or a kabane?

00:46:28.030 --> 00:46:30.240
Now's our chance. Shoot him!

00:46:30.490 --> 00:46:31.910
Father!

00:46:32.740 --> 00:46:33.580
Miyuki!

00:46:53.850 --> 00:46:57.270
Her father's a kabane,
so she'll be one too!

00:47:03.820 --> 00:47:05.940
Huh? How dare you!

00:47:50.070 --> 00:47:55.450
Then Lord Kageyuki bit
his own daughter, Miyuki,

00:47:55.950 --> 00:47:59.750
to resurrect her, even as a kabane.

00:48:00.910 --> 00:48:02.370
And that's her?

00:48:03.420 --> 00:48:04.960
In the blue light.

00:48:05.090 --> 00:48:08.050
Yes, it's Miyuki.

00:48:09.090 --> 00:48:12.800
I've seen that light before,
around Mumei.

00:48:13.890 --> 00:48:18.310
Yeah, she's become
the heart of a black smoke,

00:48:18.770 --> 00:48:24.650
and the scared spirits of the group of
kabane are concentrated in her.

00:48:26.690 --> 00:48:29.610
The whole castle will become a black smoke?

00:48:31.190 --> 00:48:36.740
Yeah, to protect itself,
the nest becomes a black smoke.

00:48:37.530 --> 00:48:39.750
She's almost at breaking point.

00:48:41.000 --> 00:48:47.090
Then she'll go on a rampage,
trying to destroy everything.

00:48:48.170 --> 00:48:49.760
Each and every thing.

00:48:51.300 --> 00:48:53.340
I know how she feels.

00:48:53.800 --> 00:48:54.800
Hey.

00:48:56.140 --> 00:48:59.640
Idiot. That won't happen this time.

00:49:00.390 --> 00:49:03.270
Together, we can prevent it.

00:49:10.440 --> 00:49:15.110
I guess the light and fear of the kabane
created a disturbing mood...

00:49:15.240 --> 00:49:17.450
which made everyone nervous.

00:49:17.910 --> 00:49:19.330
Yeah.

00:49:20.200 --> 00:49:25.080
Lets stop whoever's controlling them,
and not let Unato be destroyed.

00:49:36.550 --> 00:49:37.890
It's getting louder.

00:49:38.010 --> 00:49:39.010
A bad sign!

00:49:42.600 --> 00:49:45.640
Lord Kageyuki!
Please don't fight us!

00:49:46.600 --> 00:49:47.690
Unmo, look out!

00:49:48.980 --> 00:49:53.190
If this goes on, the Unato
that you loved will perish!

00:49:56.610 --> 00:49:58.910
Is that what you want,

00:49:59.030 --> 00:50:01.240
Lord Kageyuki?

00:50:06.670 --> 00:50:07.670
Now, Mumei!

00:50:14.210 --> 00:50:15.050
Nice shot!

00:50:49.040 --> 00:50:50.670
<i>Father.</i>

00:50:53.750 --> 00:50:54.760
<i>Miyuki.</i>

00:50:56.380 --> 00:50:57.260
<i>Am I..</i>

00:50:58.550 --> 00:51:00.180
<i>Inside their minds?</i>

00:51:09.980 --> 00:51:13.230
<i>Did the blue light show me that vision?</i>

00:51:13.900 --> 00:51:15.070
Mumei.

00:51:17.900 --> 00:51:20.070
Enemies everywhere.

00:51:21.570 --> 00:51:23.240
I must kill them!

00:51:31.250 --> 00:51:33.340
Unmo, get back!

00:51:35.380 --> 00:51:39.050
You must not lose your heart!

00:51:39.510 --> 00:51:40.800
No!

00:51:42.640 --> 00:51:45.720
You stole it!

00:51:45.970 --> 00:51:50.690
My future and my only hope.

00:51:51.980 --> 00:51:55.400
Why did you hesitate that time?

00:51:56.900 --> 00:51:59.530
Why didn't you say...

00:51:59.950 --> 00:52:02.570
that I was human?

00:52:07.790 --> 00:52:10.370
It's too late to regret it now.

00:52:10.620 --> 00:52:13.290
Let Unato perish!

00:52:19.920 --> 00:52:21.170
L...

00:52:22.130 --> 00:52:24.890
Lord Kageyuki!

00:52:37.940 --> 00:52:39.190
Mumei.

00:52:40.280 --> 00:52:41.900
Leave him to me.

00:52:43.740 --> 00:52:45.740
I don't feel sorry for him.

00:52:47.120 --> 00:52:49.620
No more sympathy.

00:53:09.470 --> 00:53:12.600
If you're so possessed by hate-

00:53:17.610 --> 00:53:19.230
Ikoma isn't like you.

00:53:41.960 --> 00:53:42.800
Mumei!

00:54:06.990 --> 00:54:08.780
Look at that!

00:54:09.660 --> 00:54:11.280
The mountain-

00:54:24.840 --> 00:54:26.840
Run! It's collapsing!

00:54:27.590 --> 00:54:30.600
They're still trying to
become a black smoke?

00:54:36.390 --> 00:54:37.770
She's crying.

00:54:40.360 --> 00:54:41.560
She's crying.

00:54:42.730 --> 00:54:44.360
She's scared.

00:54:58.710 --> 00:54:59.540
Unmo!

00:54:59.670 --> 00:55:01.000
Sukari, come on!

00:55:37.410 --> 00:55:38.540
It's blocked!

00:55:39.250 --> 00:55:41.830
- We can't go on.
- Ikoma and the others-

00:55:44.250 --> 00:55:45.500
Hurry!

00:55:54.760 --> 00:55:55.970
Kurusu!

00:55:56.970 --> 00:56:00.270
You're late. It's already dawn.

00:56:01.640 --> 00:56:03.230
Welcome back.

00:56:06.610 --> 00:56:08.780
Everyone's here.

00:56:09.610 --> 00:56:11.070
I'll reverse.

00:56:26.250 --> 00:56:27.170
The black smoke-

00:56:27.590 --> 00:56:29.090
It's getting closer.

00:56:29.210 --> 00:56:32.590
But it's collapsing.
If we can shake it off-

00:56:47.980 --> 00:56:49.280
It's latched on!

00:56:54.570 --> 00:56:56.200
This is bad.

00:56:56.830 --> 00:56:58.240
Hold on tight.

00:56:59.620 --> 00:57:00.580
Yukina.

00:57:00.700 --> 00:57:03.790
I'll speed up and hit the Irakazui Line.

00:57:03.920 --> 00:57:07.790
I only hope we can slow down
before the switchback.

00:57:09.550 --> 00:57:10.630
The track brakes!

00:57:12.260 --> 00:57:13.680
Let's give it a shot.

00:57:16.260 --> 00:57:17.550
Sukari, you awake?

00:57:17.680 --> 00:57:18.720
Yeah.

00:57:18.850 --> 00:57:20.430
<i>Another job for you.</i>

00:57:20.770 --> 00:57:23.850
Brake before the switchback.
Braking distance?

00:57:24.890 --> 00:57:26.730
At this speed,

00:57:27.730 --> 00:57:31.070
<i>600 feet. It'll take about
14 seconds to stop.</i>

00:57:31.190 --> 00:57:33.820
OK. All the brakes, simultaneously.

00:57:34.320 --> 00:57:36.490
You're in front, so give the signal.

00:57:36.740 --> 00:57:38.120
Roger.

00:57:38.910 --> 00:57:39.780
Everyone.

00:57:40.200 --> 00:57:43.960
<i>After the whistle blows for 5 seconds,
we'll brake suddenly.</i>

00:57:44.580 --> 00:57:46.920
<i>Please hold on tight to the handrails.</i>

00:58:01.350 --> 00:58:02.680
No, don't fire yet.

00:58:07.940 --> 00:58:09.020
Come on!

00:58:14.320 --> 00:58:15.030
Fire!

00:58:19.120 --> 00:58:20.280
Brake!

00:58:39.340 --> 00:58:40.600
Bye!

00:58:41.640 --> 00:58:43.060
I'm scared.

00:58:45.480 --> 00:58:47.100
Don't be scared.

00:58:48.190 --> 00:58:51.610
Hozumi, you'll make friends
with everyone.

00:59:03.990 --> 00:59:07.290
Just say "Let's play together tomorrow."

00:59:08.000 --> 00:59:09.080
OK.

00:59:19.680 --> 00:59:21.300
We've stopped.

00:59:36.360 --> 00:59:37.610
Look.

00:59:45.950 --> 00:59:47.450
Snowfall.

00:59:58.300 --> 01:00:01.050
Maybe the last one this year.

01:01:09.700 --> 01:01:11.290
A bit more water, please.

01:01:14.580 --> 01:01:15.630
Forward!

01:01:15.750 --> 01:01:16.960
Forward!

01:01:21.920 --> 01:01:25.090
I'm glad you came back safe and sound.

01:01:30.350 --> 01:01:32.100
For the overhaul.

01:01:35.980 --> 01:01:36.980
Yeah.

01:01:37.770 --> 01:01:39.860
You need manpower.

01:01:40.110 --> 01:01:40.940
Yeah.

01:01:41.900 --> 01:01:45.320
Lady Ayame, please stop
doing things like that.

01:01:47.120 --> 01:01:48.450
Alright.

01:01:48.660 --> 01:01:54.040
Charging the enemy like that with so
little training, you're too big-headed.

01:01:57.960 --> 01:01:58.790
Alright.

01:02:00.800 --> 01:02:05.260
You shouldn't say so much at meetings.
They won't respect you.

01:02:06.130 --> 01:02:06.970
Alright.

01:02:07.090 --> 01:02:08.930
Don't wash stuff.

01:02:09.350 --> 01:02:11.890
You'll get dishpan hands.

01:02:12.100 --> 01:02:12.930
Alright.

01:02:20.650 --> 01:02:23.530
Fear and hate towards humans.

01:02:23.900 --> 01:02:27.070
The kabane couldn't hold
those feelings back.

01:02:28.610 --> 01:02:34.080
Their aggravation spread throughout
Unato, and even made us nervous.

01:02:35.910 --> 01:02:37.370
It's like Takumi said.

01:02:39.960 --> 01:02:44.760
Do you think they hate
losing their buddies too?

01:02:45.090 --> 01:02:48.260
The kabane? No way.

01:02:48.800 --> 01:02:53.060
But when I look into their ghastly eyes,

01:02:53.430 --> 01:02:55.980
it seems like they hate us.

01:02:57.520 --> 01:03:01.610
When I touch their flesh,
it trembles in anger.

01:03:04.280 --> 01:03:05.690
You scaredy-cat!

01:03:06.440 --> 01:03:10.160
Hey, I'm talking seriously, Ikoma!

01:03:12.830 --> 01:03:16.700
I didn't get it at the time,
but I think he was right.

01:03:17.080 --> 01:03:21.580
The kabane virus amplifies
anger, angst and hate.

01:03:23.880 --> 01:03:27.920
But as long as you don't
lose your compassion,

01:03:28.220 --> 01:03:30.510
the bad feelings can be controlled.

01:03:31.090 --> 01:03:34.930
Just like the light that surrounded us.

01:03:36.810 --> 01:03:39.730
So there's no need to worry.

01:03:42.560 --> 01:03:43.270
OK.

01:03:45.270 --> 01:03:50.280
But I haven't forgotten my promise.
That's not what I mean.

01:03:50.780 --> 01:03:54.740
I know. Are you wearing it?

01:04:01.210 --> 01:04:02.460
You like it?

01:04:02.880 --> 01:04:03.790
Yeah.

01:04:03.960 --> 01:04:05.380
Good.

01:04:09.840 --> 01:04:12.390
That stone's pattern moves.

01:04:12.510 --> 01:04:13.720
Huh? Really?

01:04:14.180 --> 01:04:15.510
Yeah.

01:04:15.680 --> 01:04:18.430
It's moving now. Look.

01:04:31.740 --> 01:04:32.570
Huh?

01:04:32.700 --> 01:04:34.990
Oh, I'm so embarrassed!

01:04:35.370 --> 01:04:38.660
- The pattern-
- It doesn't move!

01:04:39.040 --> 01:04:40.540
Whaaat!?
